<h2>Common Causes of Sudden Roof Leaks</h2>
<ul>
<li>Shingles torn off or lifted by high winds</li>
<li>Hail cracking shingles, pipe boots or skylights</li>
<li>Failed flashing around chimneys, walls and valleys</li>
<li>Cracked rubber pipe boots that dried out in the summer heat</li>
<li>Tree limbs puncturing the roof deck</li>
<li>Clogged gutters causing water to back up under the roof edge</li>
<li>Wind-driven rain pushing water through vents or under loose trim</li>
</ul>
